                <pb facs="0199" n="93" sameAs="frus:frus1891/pg93"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Egan to Mr. Blaine</hi>.</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Santiago</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1891-01-17"><hi rendition="#italic">January 17, 1891</hi>.</date>
                        (Received January 19.)</dateline></opener>
                <p>Revolted fleet about to blockade Valparaiso, Iquique, and other ports. I have
                    advised consuls to make strong protests. Squadron urgently needed for protection
                    of United States interests.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
